# cursor-tts speech (required)

**Do not only speak at the start and end.** Mid-process important content (findings, conclusions, diffs, root causes, verified facts, risks) must be spoken immediately via MCP `speak` (≤80 chars). Multiple speaks per turn. Same for Plan subtasks.
